          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which size should I order?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>Order the size that matches your usual shoe size. If you are between sizes, or you wear a wide fit, size up. Our Sizing Guide walks you through measuring your foot in about a minute. Still unsure? Email us your shoe size and we will tell you which to pick.</p>"
          }
