        "faq_works_for_me": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will these work for me?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>They are made for people who are on their feet for long stretches — standing at work, walking a lot, or in shoes that offer little support. They sit in most closed shoes and are trim-to-fit. If your feet need something a doctor has specified, check with them first. And if these are not right for you, the 60-day guarantee covers the return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will it arrive?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Orders leave our warehouse within 1–2 business days. Standard US delivery usually takes 5–8 business days from there, and shipping is free on orders over $50. You will get a tracking link by email as soon as your parcel ships.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_returns": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I want to return them?",
            "icon": "return",
            "content": "<p>You have 60 days. Wear them, walk in them, put them through a full work week. If they are not right, email us and we will send a return label for a full refund. No photos, no phone calls, no restocking fee.</p>"
